 ("graph.legendConn", "{a}/{b} nodes with connections in the full graph", "{a}/{b} nodos con conexiones en el grafo completo", "{a}/{b} Knoten mit Verbindungen im vollst\u00e4ndigen Graph", "{a}/{b} n\u0153uds avec connexions dans le graphe complet", "{a}/{b} nodi con connessioni nel grafo completo", "完整图谱中 {a}/{b} 个节点有连接"),
 ("graph.legendIso", " \u00b7 {n} with no relation", " \u00b7 {n} sin ninguna relaci\u00f3n", " \u00b7 {n} ohne Beziehung", " \u00b7 {n} sans aucune relation", " \u00b7 {n} senza alcuna relazione", " · {n} 个没有任何关系"),
 ("graph.legendViewOne", "{n} node looks isolated", "{n} nodo aparece aislado", "{n} Knoten wirkt isoliert", "{n} n\u0153ud semble isol\u00e9", "{n} nodo appare isolato", "{n} 个节点看似孤立"),
 ("graph.legendViewOther", "{n} nodes look isolated", "{n} nodos aparecen aislados", "{n} Knoten wirken isoliert", "{n} n\u0153uds semblent isol\u00e9s", "{n} nodi appaiono isolati", "{n} 个节点看似孤立"),
 ("graph.legendViewWhy", " in this view because a filter hides its relations; in the full graph they are connected.", " en esta vista porque un filtro oculta sus relaciones; en el grafo completo s\u00ed est\u00e1n conectados.", " in dieser Ansicht, weil ein Filter ihre Beziehungen verbirgt; im vollst\u00e4ndigen Graph sind sie verbunden.", " dans cette vue car un filtre masque ses relations ; dans le graphe complet ils sont connect\u00e9s.", " in questa vista perch\u00e9 un filtro ne nasconde le relazioni; nel grafo completo sono connessi.", "，因为筛选隐藏了它们的关系；在完整图谱中它们是相连的。"),
