 ("graph.insight.isolatedOne", "1 node has no relations.", "1 nodo no tiene ninguna relaci\u00f3n.", "1 Knoten hat keine Beziehungen.", "1 n\u0153ud n\u2019a aucune relation.", "1 nodo non ha alcuna relazione.", "1 个节点没有任何关系。"),
