 ("graph.insight.groups", "The graph has {n} unconnected groups (the largest holds {m} nodes).", "El grafo tiene {n} grupos sin conexi\u00f3n entre s\u00ed (el mayor re\u00fane {m} nodos).", "Der Graph hat {n} unverbundene Gruppen (die gr\u00f6\u00dfte enth\u00e4lt {m} Knoten).", "Le graphe a {n} groupes non connect\u00e9s (le plus grand r\u00e9unit {m} n\u0153uds).", "Il grafo ha {n} gruppi non connessi tra loro (il pi\u00f9 grande riunisce {m} nodi).", "图谱有 {n} 个互不相连的组（最大的有 {m} 个节点）。"),
