 ("graph.insight.topMost", "\u00ab{name}\u00bb is the most connected node ({n}).", "\u00ab{name}\u00bb es el nodo con m\u00e1s conexiones ({n}).", "\u201e{name}\u201c ist der meistverbundene Knoten ({n}).", "\u00ab {name} \u00bb est le n\u0153ud le plus connect\u00e9 ({n}).", "\u00ab{name}\u00bb \u00e8 il nodo pi\u00f9 connesso ({n}).", "「{name}」是连接最多的节点（{n}）。"),
 ("graph.insight.hubOne", "{n} node has an unusually high connection count (degree \u2265 {t}).", "{n} nodo tiene un n\u00famero de conexiones inusualmente alto (grado \u2265 {t}).", "{n} Knoten hat eine ungew\u00f6hnlich hohe Verbindungszahl (Grad \u2265 {t}).", "{n} n\u0153ud a un nombre de connexions inhabituellement \u00e9lev\u00e9 (degr\u00e9 \u2265 {t}).", "{n} nodo ha un numero di connessioni insolitamente alto (grado \u2265 {t}).", "{n} 个节点的连接数异常高（度 ≥ {t}）。"),
 ("graph.insight.hubOther", "{n} nodes have an unusually high connection count (degree \u2265 {t}).", "{n} nodos tienen un n\u00famero de conexiones inusualmente alto (grado \u2265 {t}).", "{n} Knoten haben eine ungew\u00f6hnlich hohe Verbindungszahl (Grad \u2265 {t}).", "{n} n\u0153uds ont un nombre de connexions inhabituellement \u00e9lev\u00e9 (degr\u00e9 \u2265 {t}).", "{n} nodi hanno un numero di connessioni insolitamente alto (grado \u2265 {t}).", "{n} 个节点的连接数异常高（度 ≥ {t}）。"),
 ("graph.insight.recentAct", "Recent activity: {n} items changed on {date} or later.", "Actividad reciente: {n} elementos con cambios el {date} o despu\u00e9s.", "Aktuelle Aktivit\u00e4t: {n} Elemente mit \u00c4nderungen am {date} oder sp\u00e4ter.", "Activit\u00e9 r\u00e9cente : {n} \u00e9l\u00e9ments modifi\u00e9s le {date} ou apr\u00e8s.", "Attivit\u00e0 recente: {n} elementi modificati il {date} o dopo.", "最近动态：{n} 个条目在 {date} 或之后有变更。"),
 ("destroy.courseT", "Delete course", "Eliminar curso", "Kurs l\u00f6schen", "Supprimer le cours", "Elimina corso", "删除课程"),
 ("destroy.courseC", "\u00ab{label}\u00bb will be deleted with its modules and lessons. Linked notes and cards are kept but lose their course link. This cannot be undone.", "Se eliminar\u00e1 \u00ab{label}\u00bb junto con sus m\u00f3dulos y lecciones. Las notas y tarjetas asociadas se conservar\u00e1n, pero perder\u00e1n su v\u00ednculo con el curso. Esta acci\u00f3n no se puede deshacer.", "\u201e{label}\u201c wird mit Modulen und Lektionen gel\u00f6scht. Verkn\u00fcpfte Notizen und Karten bleiben, verlieren aber ihre Kursbindung. Dies kann nicht r\u00fcckg\u00e4ngig gemacht werden.", "« {label} » sera supprim\u00e9 avec ses modules et le\u00e7ons. Les notes et cartes li\u00e9es sont conserv\u00e9es mais perdent leur lien au cours. Irr\u00e9versible.", "«{label}» verr\u00e0 eliminato con i suoi moduli e lezioni. Le note e carte collegate sono conservate ma perdono il legame al corso. Azione irreversibile.", "将删除「{label}」及其模块和课时。关联的笔记和卡片会保留，但失去与课程的关联。此操作无法撤销。"),
 ("destroy.courseOk", "Delete course", "Eliminar curso", "Kurs l\u00f6schen", "Supprimer le cours", "Elimina corso", "删除课程"),
 ("destroy.moduleT", "Delete module", "Eliminar m\u00f3dulo", "Modul l\u00f6schen", "Supprimer le module", "Elimina modulo", "删除模块"),
 ("destroy.moduleC", "\u00ab{label}\u00bb and all its lessons will be deleted. Linked notes are kept. This cannot be undone.", "Se eliminar\u00e1 \u00ab{label}\u00bb y todas sus lecciones. Las notas asociadas se conservar\u00e1n. Esta acci\u00f3n no se puede deshacer.", "\u201e{label}\u201c und alle seine Lektionen werden gel\u00f6scht. Verkn\u00fcpfte Notizen bleiben. Dies kann nicht r\u00fcckg\u00e4ngig gemacht werden.", "« {label} » et toutes ses le\u00e7ons seront supprim\u00e9s. Les notes associ\u00e9es sont conserv\u00e9es. Irr\u00e9versible.", "«{label}» e tutte le sue lezioni verranno eliminati. Le note associate sono conservate. Azione irreversibile.", "将删除「{label}」及其所有课时。关联的笔记会保留。此操作无法撤销。"),
 ("destroy.moduleOk", "Delete module", "Eliminar m\u00f3dulo", "Modul l\u00f6schen", "Supprimer le module", "Elimina modulo", "删除模块"),
 ("destroy.lessonT", "Delete lesson", "Eliminar lecci\u00f3n", "Lektion l\u00f6schen", "Supprimer la le\u00e7on", "Elimina lezione", "删除课时"),
 ("destroy.lessonC", "\u00ab{label}\u00bb will be deleted. Linked notes are kept but lose their lesson link. This cannot be undone.", "Se eliminar\u00e1 \u00ab{label}\u00bb. Las notas asociadas se conservar\u00e1n, pero perder\u00e1n su v\u00ednculo con la lecci\u00f3n. Esta acci\u00f3n no se puede deshacer.", "\u201e{label}\u201c wird gel\u00f6scht. Verkn\u00fcpfte Notizen bleiben, verlieren aber ihre Lektionsbindung. Dies kann nicht r\u00fcckg\u00e4ngig gemacht werden.", "« {label} » sera supprim\u00e9. Les notes associ\u00e9es sont conserv\u00e9es mais perdent leur lien \u00e0 la le\u00e7on. Irr\u00e9versible.", "«{label}» verr\u00e0 eliminata. Le note associate sono conservate ma perdono il legame alla lezione. Azione irreversibile.", "将删除「{label}」。关联的笔记会保留，但失去与课时的关联。此操作无法撤销。"),
